#: ../../../reference/interfaces/tee-interface.md:2
msgid "tee interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/tee-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The `tee` interface  permits access to Trusted Execution Environment (TEE) "
"devices via the [TEE subsystem](https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/tee/"
"index.html) in the Linux kernel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/tee-interface.md:7
msgid ""
"This interface is primarily intended to be used with {ref}`Ubuntu Core <ref-"
"glossary_ubuntu-core>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/tee-interface.md:10
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/tee-interface.md:12
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/tee-interface.md:12
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/tee-interface.md:15
msgid ""
"Intended for snaps needing to access the TEE subsystem over `/dev/"
"tee[0-9]*`, `/dev/teepriv[0-0]*` or  the Qualcomm equivalent _qseecom_  "
"(Qualcomm Secure Execution Environment Communicator) at `/dev/qseecom`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/tee-interface.md:17
msgid "Code examples"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/tee-interface.md:19
msgid ""
"The official [Ubuntu Core gadget snap](https://github.com/kubiko/imx-gadget) "
"for the [i.MX8M Mini Evaluation Kit](https://www.nxp.com/design/design-"
"center/development-boards-and-designs/8MMINILPD4-EVK) uses this interface: "
"https://github.com/kubiko/imx-gadget/blob/24/imx8mm-evk/snap/snapcraft.yaml"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/tee-interface.md:21
msgid ""
"The test code can be found in the snapd repository: https://github.com/"
"canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/tee_test.go"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/tee-interface.md:23
msgid ""
"The source code for the interface is in the snapd repository: https://"
"github.com/canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/tee.go"
msgstr ""
